    19.3 Method: Python requests, Authorization Bearer <PAT>, PUT https://api.github.com/repos/swill008/JoystickGremlin_/contents/<path> with message, content (base64), sha, branch. Branch for Button Map is VKB-joystick-Button-Map.
    19.4 Never write the PAT into grok_rules, the repo, commit messages, or artifacts. It lives in project instructions / this chat only.
